infographic chart-column-simple
data
  title Cardinality explosion: one unbounded label
  desc Active series = product of label cardinalities. Adding user_id (1M values) multiplies 2,000 series into 2 billion.
  values
    - label service×status×region (50×8×5)
      value 2000
    - label + user_id (×1,000,000)
      value 2000000000
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
